# Branch policy

## main branch

- Use for releases, GitHub Pages, and external collaboration.
- Core chat does not depend on Python orchestration tooling.

## dev / feature branches

When building new features:

1. Branch from main: `git checkout -b dev`
2. Keep changes focused; merge back to main when stable.

